Third-party and vendored components
-----------------------------------

src/vendor/smack_core.c and src/vendor/smack_core.h are vendored from smack
(https://github.com/timncox/schwung-smack), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Tim Cox.

src/vendor/plugin_api_v1.h is vendored from schwung
(https://github.com/charlesvestal/schwung), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Charles Vestal.

Building this firmware requires libDaisy (https://github.com/electro-smith/libDaisy,
MIT License, Copyright (c) Electrosmith) and the Alchemy SDK
(https://github.com/hermetic-modular/alchemy-sdk). Both are git submodules under
lib/ and are not redistributed here.

Break is a clean-room, Ectocore-style instrument. It contains no code or samples
from Ectocore or ectocore.rocks; the WAVs in emu-card/ are synthesised by
tools/make_test_card.py. Hermetic Modular and Alchemy Lab are names of Hermetic
Modular. This project is not made, tested or supported by Hermetic Modular.
